TI  - Perovskite-gold shell composite nanoprobe for trimodal lateral flow immunoassay 
      detection of SARS-CoV-2 antibodies.
PG  - 5015-5018
LID - 10.1039/d5cc07358h [doi]
AB  - A CsPbBr(3)@SiO(2)-Au(shell) nanoprobe enables trimodal 
      (colorimetric/fluorescent/photothermal) lateral flow immunochromatographic assay 
      for SARS-CoV-2 IgG detection. This multi-signal approach offers environmental 
      adaptability and internal cross-verification, with the photothermal mode 
      achieving the highest sensitivity (LOD: 0.4 ng mL(-1)). The work presents a 
      robust strategy for sensitive point-of-care testing.
